#X msg 130 775 @integration;
#X text 270 775 Integration constant. Тип: float. Значение по умолчанию:
0\. Диапазон: 0\...1\.;
#X msg 130 817 @modfreq;
#X text 270 817 Frequency of the sine wave for the modulation of theta
(works if @modetype=3). Тип: float. Единицы: 'Hz'. Значение по умолчанию:
220\. Диапазон: 20\...1000\.;
#X msg 130 874 @modtype;
#X text 270 874 Modulation type. 0=theta is modulated by the incoming
signal. 1=theta is modulated by the averaged incoming signal. 2=theta
is modulated by the squared incoming signal. 3=theta is modulated by
a sine wave of frequency @modfreq. 4=theta is modulated by a sine wave
of frequency @freq. Тип: int. Значение по умолчанию: 0\. Диапазон:
0\...4\.;
